# Phrases that may stay, one per line, matched without regard to case.
# Keep this list short.  Each phrase has a use in which it is plain English.
the original text
the original is not changed
original text
original and replacement
# APPS: appcfg1.src, appcfg2.src, appcmd2.src: the configuration key stred and
# the environment variable STRED are set by the user and keep their names.
{c:stred}
{c:STRED}
stred=
stred |
STRED |
environment variable STRED
# GETTING STARTED (gs-install.src, gs-start.src): the owner asked
# for the paths of what the install makes and for examples that start the
# programs: the file names of the programs are part of those paths.  No other
# use of the names is allowed.
bin/str
bin/dviview
# The option of the terminal multiplexer tmux that starts it in UTF-8 mode.
tmux -u
